Parallel-execution | Tags in Cucumber Framework
    1. Once Tags are used above Feature
            When used this will be applicable to all scenarios
    2. Once tags are used above Scenario/ Scenario-Outline
            When used this will be applicable to only specific scenario
    3. Once 2 different tags are used above scenario or feature
            When used this will applicable to same as aove

Usage: Add
    1. tags = "@Smoke", "@Sanity", "@Regression", "Prod",
    2. tags = "@Smoke or @Sanity", [which ever has this 2 tags in the feature file will be executed parallel]
    3. tags = "not @prod" [if used this way then this particular tags will be excluded when test run]
    4. tags = "@All" [this tags will be used above feature only it means it will inherit all such tags present under scenario will be executed]
